sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API
    participant Prisma
    participant Redis
    participant Mailer

    %% REGISTER
    User->>API: POST /register (name, email, password)
    API->>API: Middleware - RateLimiterDevice
    API->>Prisma: Check if user exists
    Prisma-->>API: User not found
    API->>Prisma: Create new user
    Prisma-->>API: User created
    API-->>User: 201 User registered successfully

    %% LOGIN
    User->>API: POST /login (email, password, deviceId)
    API->>API: Middleware - RateLimiterDevice
    API->>Prisma: Validate user credentials
    Prisma-->>API: User valid
    API->>Prisma: Check deviceId
    alt Device registered
        API->>Redis: Generate tokens (access + refresh)
        Redis-->>API: Token stored
        API-->>User: 200 Login success (tokens issued)
    else New device
        API->>Mailer: Send verification email
        Mailer-->>User: Verification link
        User->>API: GET /verify-device?token=xyz
        API->>Prisma: Mark device as verified
        API-->>User: Device verified, please login again
    end

    %% REFRESH TOKEN
    User->>API: POST /refresh (refreshToken)
    API->>API: Middleware - RateLimiter
    API->>Redis: Validate refresh token
    alt Valid
        API->>Redis: Issue new access token
        API-->>User: New access token
    else Invalid
        API-->>User: 401 Unauthorized (re-login required)
    end

    %% LOGOUT
    User->>API: POST /logout
    API->>API: Middleware - RateLimiter
    API->>Redis: Delete refresh token
    API-->>User: 200 Logout success

    %% DEVICE MANAGEMENT
    User->>API: GET /devices
    API->>API: Middleware - Check AccessToken
    API->>API: Middleware - RateLimiter
    API->>Prisma: Get list of verified devices
    Prisma-->>API: Devices list
    API-->>User: List of devices

    User->>API: DELETE /devices/:id
    API->>API: Middleware - Check AccessToken
    API->>API: Middleware - RateLimiter
    API->>Prisma: Remove specific device
    API-->>User: Device access revoked

    %% PASSWORD FLOW
    User->>API: POST /forgot-password (email)
    API->>API: Middleware - RateLimiter
    API->>Mailer: Send reset link
    Mailer-->>User: Reset password email

    User->>API: POST /reset-password (token, newPassword)
    API->>API: Middleware - RateLimiter
    API->>Prisma: Update password
    API-->>User: Password reset success

    %% CHANGE PASSWORD (logged-in)
    User->>API: POST /change-password (oldPassword, newPassword)
    API->>API: Middleware - RateLimiter
    API->>Prisma: Validate old password
    Prisma-->>API: Valid
    API->>Prisma: Update password
    API-->>User: Password changed successfully

    Note over API,DB: 🔒 All endpoints (except register/login/forgot/reset) require an accessToken.
    Note over API,Redis: ⚙️ All requests pass through the RateLimiter middleware.
    Note over API,DB: ⚙️ The limiter for login and register uses a device limiter.